    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Panda is a horticulture planning and logging tool operated by
      <strong>Upstate Web Co.</strong> ("we", "us"), through its product
      sister-brand <strong>Shira</strong>, which is incorporating a Kenyan
